# Result
This repository contains experimental results for NPETest and other tools. 

All experimental results performed by the script files will be stored in this directory.

The sub-directories will be automatically generated after running the scripts.

## Structure

```
.
├── ...                            Directories for storing the results of each tool
└── npetest                  
    ├── ...                        Experiment Trials
    └── npetest_result             Experimental results for our main results
            ├── ...
            └── NPEX               Experimental results on NPEX benchmarksCore algorithm of SymTuner
                 ├── ...
                 └── ZooKeeper-ef3649f5      Experimental results of ZooKeeper benchmark project
                     ├── ...
                     └── 79660...            Identification number for docker container (representing one trial for experiments)
                            
```
  
#!/usr/bin/env bash

# GENERATE csv files for each tool and benchmark (# of found known NPEs)
current=$(pwd)

cp ${current}/benchmarks/benchmark_list_ori.txt ${current}/benchmarks/benchmark_list.txt
rm ${current}/result/*.csv

${current}/scripts/check_log_file.sh ./result/evosuite/evosuite_opt_result ./result/evosuite_result.csv
${current}/scripts/check_log_file.sh ./result/npetest/npetest_result ./result/npetest_result.csv
${current}/scripts/check_log_file.sh ./result/randoop/randoop_result ./result/randoop_result.csv

${current}/scripts/merge_csv_files.sh ${current}/result/main_merge.csv

python3 ${current}/scripts/build_table.py ${current}/result/main_merge.csv ${current}/result/main_result.txt
</output>
